From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johannes Stein <johannesstein@freeze-dev.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:33:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 116/116] compiler: review fixes for the 2026 optimisations

Restrict SLP pointer provenance to locals whose pointee is provably the
same object, hoist only unconditionally evaluated loads, keep the negated
loop guard, drop the exception-safe regvar pass on SEH and psabieh
targets, and gate the new node and peephole optimisations to x86_64,
the only target they were validated on.
